      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jHObJhSXfIqDq9aNPVv9H",
      "originalText": "it's a technique that allows us to connect a set of data/documents to an LLM so it can look up before answering a question based on data/docs we provided",
